# Hero video — the raw client source and the working trim preview stay OUT of git.
# Only the FINAL compressed clip (H.264, audio stripped, ~2-3MB) gets committed, and
# that final clip now LIVES AT brand_assets/hero-background.mp4 — so that path is
# deliberately NOT ignored. Raw sources belong in brand_assets/*-raw.* instead.
brand_assets/hero-background-preview.mp4
brand_assets/*-raw.mp4
brand_assets/*-raw.mov

# CTA background — the PNG source stays on disk for re-encoding, but only the
# WebP that the pages actually reference ships. The PNG is 2.2MB vs 275KB.
brand_assets/cta-background.png

# Social share card — same rule. og-image.png is the 1376x768 design source;
# the pages reference the cropped 1200x630 og-image.jpg (2.0MB vs 148KB).
brand_assets/og-image.png

# Unreferenced client photos. Kept on disk as a source pool to draw from when
# filling future photo slots, but no page links them, so they must not ship.
# Anything promoted into a page must be removed from this list.
